HST Office: the new Start Center (the window shown when no document is open), drawn in the HST look.

- One VCL canvas draws the whole Start Center with anti-aliased vectors, alike on Windows, Linux and macOS:
  the light-blue background with its soft curve, the pale blue left panel, rounded pills, cards, tiles and
  focus rings, in a light and a dark palette. Only the search entry is a toolkit widget, placed into the
  canvas's slot for it.
- Left: the HST Office logo; Trang chủ, Tài liệu mới (menu: Văn bản, Bảng tính, Trình chiếu, Bản vẽ, Từ mẫu…),
  Mở tệp, Tài liệu chưa lưu (org.hst.office.vi:UnsavedDocuments), Gần đây, Đã ghim, Cập nhật HST Office
  (org.hst.office.update:Check), with the mockup's spacing (a 40 px pill every 44 px); below a separator (no
  banner: the owner took it out of the Start Center) the one-line heading "HASON TECH - Giải pháp
  chuyển đổi số", six solution button cards in two columns (the solution's 20 px logo, from images shipped
  at 24 and 48 px, and an external-link mark; the name; the short tagline in at most two lines, the full one as tooltip
  and description; hover, pressed and focus states) and the link to hasontech.vn. No shared files, no account.
  The column fits the 741 px below the menu bar of a 1366 x 768 screen and the 674 px a maximised Windows
  window keeps there without scrolling; in shorter windows the menu rows tighten first (never below 24 px
  or the text + 4).
- Centre: "Chào mừng bạn quay lại", a search field that filters the recent documents with or without Vietnamese
  accents, three tinted tiles with the HST application icons, and the "Gần đây" table (Tên, Đã mở, Vị trí,
  pin, "⋯" menu: Mở, Mở vị trí tệp, Ghim/Bỏ ghim, Xóa khỏi danh sách).
- Right: the "Được ghim" card (the history's own pinned flag, kept in the profile).
- The canvas does its own hit-testing, hover, press, focus and scrolling; Tab, arrows, Home/End, Page Up/Down,
  Enter, Space, the context menu key and F6 work everywhere. Every drawn item is an accessible object
  (regions, push buttons, list items) with name, description, states and actions.
- The colours, type scale, radii, spacing, shadow, states and icon sizes are the HST design tokens
  (include/vcl/hst/designtokens.hxx) and the shapes the HST drawing helpers (include/vcl/hst/drawhelpers.hxx),
  shared by every HST surface drawn in this look.
- The layout scales with the UI factor or the display's DPI, whichever is larger, so the columns grow with the
  point-sized type (Windows at 125 % keeps the UI factor at 1).
- Small windows: the Pinned card folds into the table (decided at the window's own scale). A window still
  too small for the design's sizes (the left column taller than the window, the centre short of two rows of
  the Recent table, a heading or tile label that would need an ellipsis, or narrower than the full left
  column needs) shrinks the whole Start Center by the largest share that fits, down to 60 %: measures,
  icons, the logo, spacing and type alike, the search entry's type too. Where a platform's type runs wider
  than the design's, so that a menu label or a solution name would be cut, the type alone shrinks until
  it fits. At the design's size nothing changes. The Recent table and the Pinned card draw whole rows
  only; the rest shows when the list is scrolled to it. Only a window too small even at 60 % scrolls the left
  column (or, below the full column's width, shows the menu as glyphs). File times are read on a worker
  thread; no thumbnails are loaded.
- Start-up: the gradients are drawn natively (no step count, which Cairo and Skia refuse), only the logo of the
  theme shown is rendered, and the application icons are the brand's PNGs (assets/brand/icons), not SVGs.

Hook: sfx2/source/dialog/backingcomp.cxx creates HstStartCenterWindow instead of BackingWindow (4 lines);
makefile and translation entries. The logic is in new HST files (LicenseRef-HST-Proprietary):
sfx2/source/startcenter/*, sfx2/inc/startcenter/*, sfx2/uiconfig/ui/hststartcentersearch.ui (its only
toplevel: VclBuilder builds every toplevel of a file into the asking window), include/vcl/hst/*, vcl/source/hst/*.
Test: CppunitTest_sfx2_hst_startcenter.
